---
import AuthPanel from "../../components/forum/AuthPanel";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Forum Auth | OpenGlass Hub</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="OpenGlass Hub Forum Phase 3 最小认证入口：登录、注册、会话状态与发帖门控。"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial;
        background: #0b0e16;
        color: #e8edf8;
      }
      main {
        padding: 2rem 1rem 4rem;
        max-width: 920px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
      h1 {
        margin-top: 0;
      }
      a {
        color: #7cb5ff;
      }
      .nav {
        display: flex;
        gap: 1rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <div class="nav">
        <a href="/">返回文档首页</a>
        <a href="/community/">社区页</a>
        <a href="/developers/">开发者页</a>
      </div>
      <h1>Forum Phase 3：Auth Gate</h1>
      <p>当前页面用于验证 Supabase Auth 与会话门控，不包含发帖编辑器与评论 UI。</p>
      <AuthPanel client:only="react" />
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
